# round 130 (w147): the deletion-only store arm (w140_p1 bxdelstore, the best betaxanthin cell) with the store affine FROZEN for the first 40 epochs (--ess-affine-start-epoch 40). Rounds 117, 123 and 125 measured the affine keeping the backbone on the plateau (3/6 seeds at width 12, 4/6 at width 90; the wide control 0/6): rank up, top-50 call down. The corrected-graph control's validation loss bottoms at a median epoch of 32 and its Pearson peaks at a median of 28, so at 40 most seeds have escaped. Paired against w140_bxdelstore and w137_bxdel.
